      "content": "it doesn't matter. i've tried all the little fixes. it's not a bug, it's the actual hardware. the foundation is just corrupted. i look at my life and it's just one long sequence of fatal errors. i'm tired of trying to reboot and having the same thing happen every single time. it feels like the only way to actually stop the errors is to just... stop the process entirely.",
